  "id": "somatoform-pain-disorder",
  "term": "somatoform pain disorder",
  "definition": "Somatoform pain disorder, described here as persistent somatoform pain disorder, is a mental disorder in which ongoing pain occurs without an associated bodily injury. It can involve major problems in bodily sensation and emotional functioning, and has been linked to disturbances in pain, memory, and emotion processing.",
